---
<Base title="Contact ANVERA" description="Contact ANVERA about forged wheel projects, product enquiries and dealer partnerships.">
  <section class="contact-hero"><div class="contact-hero-inner"><p class="eyebrow">ANVERA / CONTACT</p><h1>Every project<br /><span>starts somewhere.</span></h1><p>For product questions, custom projects and partnership enquiries, prepare a short brief and our team can direct your request.</p></div></section>
  <section class="contact-content"><div><p class="section-kicker">Choose your direction</p><h2>How can we<br />help you?</h2><p>For a vehicle-specific wheel project, use the custom inquiry worksheet. For dealer partnership, visit our network page.</p></div><div class="contact-options"><a href="/custom-inquiry"><span>01 / PRIVATE & CUSTOM</span><h3>Wheel project inquiry</h3><b>Start a project ↗</b></a><a href="/dealers"><span>02 / TRADE & PARTNERSHIP</span><h3>Dealer network</h3><b>Explore partnership ↗</b></a><a href="/wheels"><span>03 / PRODUCT INFORMATION</span><h3>Wheel collection</h3><b>Explore wheels ↗</b></a></div></section>
</Base>
